==Unlocking==
This Mount ''cannot'' be obtained through [[Items#Crafting|Item Crafting]].

Initially made available as a free drop during the 2023 '''Anniversary''' [[Event]]. It is now available for unlock during other annual events by redeeming with a specific amount of event currency.

Event Mounts alternate between this and {{ItemTooltip|Crystallized Echo}}. This mount may be obtained during the following [[Events|events]]:
* [[Eggplague]]
* [[Harvest]]
* [[Christmas]]

